#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:19
msgid ""
"Messages, services, and actions are collectively called ``interfaces`` in "
"ROS 2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:22
msgid "Interface definitions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:24
msgid ""
"Message files must end in ``.msg`` and must be located in the subfolder "
"``msg``. Service files must end in ``.srv`` and must be located in the "
"subfolder ``srv``. Actions files must end in ``.action`` and must be located "
"in the subfolder ``action``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:28
msgid ""
"These files might need to be updated to comply with the `ROS Interface "
"definition <http://design.ros2.org/articles/legacy_interface_definition."
"html>`__. Some primitive types have been removed and the types ``duration`` "
"and ``time`` which were builtin types in ROS 1 have been replaced with "
"normal message definitions and must be used from the `builtin_interfaces "
"<https://github.com/ros2/rcl_interfaces/tree/rolling/builtin_interfaces>`__ "
"package. Also some naming conventions are stricter than in ROS 1. There is "
"additional information in the :doc:`conceptual article <../../ROS-Framework/"
"interfaces/About-Interfaces>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:34
msgid "Building interfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:36
msgid ""
"The way in which interfaces are built in ROS 2 differs substantially from "
"ROS 1. Interfaces can only be built from packages containing a ``CMakeLists."
"txt``. If you are developing a pure Python package, then the interfaces "
"should be placed in a different package containing only the interfaces "
"(which is best practice anyway). See the :doc:`custom interfaces tutorial "
"<../../ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Custom-"
"ROS2-Interfaces>` for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:42
msgid "Migrating interface package to ROS 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:44
msgid "In your ``package.xml``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:46
msgid "Add ``<buildtool_depend>rosidl_default_generators</buildtool_depend>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:47
msgid "Add ``<exec_depend>rosidl_default_runtime</exec_depend>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:48
msgid "Add ``<member_of_group>rosidl_interface_packages</member_of_group>``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:49
msgid ""
"For each dependent message package, add ``<depend>message_package</depend>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:51
msgid "In your ``CMakeLists.txt``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:53
msgid "Enable C++20"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:55
msgid "set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:59
msgid "Add ``find_package(rosidl_default_generators REQUIRED)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Migration-and-Upgrades/Migrating-from-ROS1/Migrating-Interfaces.rst:60
msgid ""
"For each dependent message package, add ``find_package(message_package "
"REQUIRED)`` and replace the CMake function call to ``generate_messages`` "
"with ``rosidl_generate_interfaces``."
msgstr ""

